---
import { execFileSync } from "node:child_process";
import ToolLayout from "../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro";
import { withBase } from "../../lib/base";
import { usageRevision } from "../../lib/usage";
import { anchorFor } from "../../../../scripts/lib/anchors.mjs";
import { INTEGRATION_KINDS } from "../../../../schemas/lock.mjs";
import index from "../../../../exports/task-inputs.json";
let source = null;
if (usageRevision) {
  const committed = JSON.parse(execFileSync("git", ["show", `${usageRevision}:exports/task-inputs.json`], { encoding: "utf8", maxBuffer: 8 * 1024 * 1024 }));
  if (JSON.stringify(committed) !== JSON.stringify(index)) throw new Error("Task inputs differ from the advertised revision; commit generated artifacts before a pinned build.");
  const seconds = Number(execFileSync("git", ["show", "-s", "--format=%ct", usageRevision], { encoding: "utf8" }).trim());
  source = { revision: usageRevision, resolvedAt: new Date(seconds * 1000).toISOString() };
}
---
<ToolLayout title="Build a task kit" description="Select component contracts and package one pinned, reproducible implementation task.">
  <p>The kit contains selected specifications, shared rules, required tokens, source digests, a lock file and a bounded task prompt. Task text stays in this page; generation needs no account or model service.</p>
  <p>Standard includes available recipes. Minimal omits only optional recipes; both retain all required contracts and rules. The legacy single-component <code>--strict</code> reconstruction command remains separate.</p>
  {!source && <p>This local build has no committed source pin. Commit generated inputs and build with <code>GITHUB_SHA</code> set to that full commit to enable packaging, or use the CLI at a committed revision.</p>}
  <noscript><p>Interactive packaging needs JavaScript. Use the CLI below or download the <a href={withBase("exports/task-inputs.json")}>dependency index</a> and <a href={withBase("agents/consume.md")}>consumption contract</a>.</p></noscript>
  <form data-kit-form class="kit-form js-only">
    <fieldset><legend>Component selection</legend>
      <p><button type="button" class="btn" data-kit-example>Use settings-form selection</button> <button type="button" class="btn" data-kit-clear>Clear selection</button></p>
      <div class="kit-components">{Object.entries(index.components).map(([id, entry]) => <label><input type="checkbox" name="component" value={id} /> {entry.title}</label>)}</div>
    </fieldset>
    <label for={anchorFor.kitControl("task")}>Implementation task</label>
    <textarea id={anchorFor.kitControl("task")} name="task" rows="4" maxlength="12000" required placeholder="Describe the interface and the changes authorized in the consumer project." />
    <div class="kit-fields">
      <label for={anchorFor.kitControl("id")}>Integration ID</label><input id={anchorFor.kitControl("id")} name="integration-id" required maxlength="120" />
      <label for={anchorFor.kitControl("version")}>Integration version</label><input id={anchorFor.kitControl("version")} name="integration-version" required maxlength="120" />
      <label for={anchorFor.kitControl("kind")}>Integration kind</label><select id={anchorFor.kitControl("kind")} name="integration-kind">{INTEGRATION_KINDS.map((kind) => <option value={kind}>{kind}</option>)}</select>
      <label for={anchorFor.kitControl("mode")}>Mode</label><select id={anchorFor.kitControl("mode")} name="mode"><option value="standard">Standard — include available recipes</option><option value="minimal">Minimal — contracts and rules, omit recipes</option></select>
    </div>
    <p>Delivery profile: <code>{index.profile}</code>. Proposed and historical profiles cannot become delivery kits. Pending roles retain their required decision disclosures.</p>
    <button class="btn" type="submit" disabled={!source}>Build kit</button>
    <p role="status" aria-live="polite" data-kit-status></p>
  </form>
  <section hidden data-kit-result>
    <h2>Generated kit</h2>
    <p data-kit-summary></p>
    <p><a data-kit-download download="j3w1-task-kit.zip">Download ZIP</a> · <button type="button" class="btn" data-kit-copy>Copy complete Markdown kit</button></p>
    <label for={anchorFor.kitControl("output")}>Complete Markdown kit</label>
    <textarea id={anchorFor.kitControl("output")} data-kit-output readonly rows="12" />
  </section>
  <h2>CLI</h2>
  <p>Run from a checkout containing the task-kit command. Supply the consumer integration identity and a new directory whose parent exists. Existing directories are never replaced. Omit <code>--ref</code> to pin the checkout’s current commit.</p>
  <pre tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Task kit command, scrollable"><code>npm run task:kit -- --components text-field,checkbox,button,dialog --task "Implement a settings form" --integration-id settings --integration-version 1 --mode standard --out ../settings-kit</code></pre>
  <p><a href={withBase("exports/task-inputs.json")}>Dependency index</a> · <a href={withBase("agents/consume.md")}>Consumer authority and reporting contract</a></p>
  <script type="application/json" id={anchorFor.kitControl("data")} set:html={JSON.stringify({ index, source }).replaceAll("<", "\\u003c")} />
  <script>import "../../scripts/kit";</script>
</ToolLayout>
